## 3. Modular ownership boundaries

Preserved event split:

```text
runtime/bus/actionEvent.mjs
  validation and normalization of action-event envelopes only

runtime/bus/actionEventHistory.mjs
  bounded retained history/readback only; stream deltas are not recorded here in v1

runtime/bus/actionEventSubscriptionRegistry.mjs
  live same-process listener registration, filtering, stream-delta opt-in gating, publication, and unsubscribe behavior only

runtime/bus/actionEventReplay.mjs
  optional retained replay/live-join orchestration only; it passes includeStreamDeltas to the live subscription layer but does not retain or replay deltas from history

runtime/bus/actionStreamDeltaEvents.mjs
  maps injected parent-side request stream observations to live-only action.stream.delta events using actionRequests requestId lookup and injected event publication

runtime/bus/executeAction/actionRequestRegistry.mjs
  active actionId/requestId metadata lookup for cancelAction and stream-delta mapping

runtime.mjs
  composition root / dependency injection / public API export only
```

No broad event manager was introduced.

`actionStreamDeltaEvents.mjs` does not import or own:

```text
runtime.mjs
workerBridge.mjs
llama_worker/**
runtime/request/**
runtime/stream/**
runtime/lifecycle/**
runtime/backends/**
runtime/router/**
runtime/services/**
streamController
scheduler
recordActionEvent
```

---

## 4. Stream-delta behavior

When a worker stream message arrives in the parent runtime:

```text
workerProtocolRouter receives worker stream chunk
  -> normalizeToken(...)
  -> req.finalText += token
  -> injected observeStreamDelta(req.id, token, req)
  -> pushStream(req, token, config)
```

The observer is no-throw:

```text
stream-delta publication errors do not affect finalText accumulation
stream-delta listener errors do not affect pushStream
stream-delta mapping failures return null and do not affect prompt/output behavior
```

Published stream-delta event shape:

```js
{
    type: "action.stream.delta",
    actionId,
    runId,
    capability: "text.generate",
    timestamp,
    data: {
        delta,
        index,
        requestId,
        chunkKind: "text",
        emittedAt,
        backend
    }
}
```

Index semantics:

```text
index starts at 0 per active actionId
index increments per published stream-delta event
index is a publication-order chunk index, not a model token ID and not a byte/char offset
```

Stream-delta retention policy:

```text
live-only in v1
not recorded through actionEventHistory
no retained history sequence number
not replayed from history
not durable
```

---

## 5. Public/API state

Current public runtime API surface is unchanged:

```text
cancelAction
cancelPrompt
executeAction
initModel
prompt
readActionEvents
resetModel
resetSession
shutdownRuntime
subscribeActionEvents
```

`subscribeActionEvents(...)` now supports:

```text
live same-process observation by default
opt-in retained in-memory replay with { replay: true }
opt-in live stream deltas with { includeStreamDeltas: true }
idempotent unsubscribe
listener-first replay shorthand
filter + listener form
```

Supported live subscription filters:

```text
actionId
runId
type
capability
```

Important default:

```text
includeStreamDeltas defaults to false
```

This keeps existing action-event subscribers from receiving high-volume stream chunks unless explicitly opted in.

